    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "IF YOU NEED THIS BAG\n…MAYBE YOU NEED\nSEA-LEGS\nSea-Legs - New Zealand's most\npopular travel sickness remedy by far.\nWhether you're going by plane, train,\nship or road, take Sea-Legs before you\ngo and you probably won't need a bag\nlike this. For any form of travel sickness\ntake effective, long acting Sea-Legs\ntablets - safe for adults and children.\nPHARMACY-ONLY MEDICINE\nSEA-LEGS\nPREVENT TRAVEL SICKNESS\nThe Boots Company (New Zealand) Limited, Wellington",
      "Air Sickness.\nIn the event of air sickness,\nafter use, close by folding and\ncall cabin attendant for\ndisposal.\nAnsett New Zealand.\n2003.065.147"
    ],
